@startuml Resolve Product/Warehouse Names via Event-Carried State Transfer

title 方案 A：事件同步（Inventory 訂閱 Product/Warehouse 的建立事件，本地存一份唯讀快取）

== 寫入側（商品名稱同步 —— Ordering 已有 Kafka/Outbox，這段是「便宜」的擴充）==

box "Ordering" #WhiteSmoke
    participant "CreateProductCommandHandler" as ProductHandler
    participant "ProductCreated\nDomainEventHandler" as ProductDomainHandler
    participant "OutboxProcessor" as OrderingOutbox
end box

queue "Kafka\n新 topic：ordering.products.events" as ProductTopic

box "Inventory" #LightYellow
    participant "IntegrationEventConsumer" as Consumer
    participant "ProductReferenceUpdated\nIntegrationEventHandler" as ProductRefHandler
end box

database "inventory_db\n（新表：product_references）" as DB

ProductHandler -> ProductHandler : Product.Create(...)\nRaiseDomainEvent(ProductCreatedDomainEvent)
ProductDomainHandler -> OrderingOutbox : WriteAsync(ProductCreatedIntegrationEvent\n(ProductId, ProductNo, Name, UnitName))
OrderingOutbox -> ProductTopic : produce（背景輪詢送出，跟今天 Inbound/Outbound 事件同一套機制）
ProductTopic -> Consumer : consumer.Consume()
Consumer -> ProductRefHandler : HandleAsync(notification, ct)
ProductRefHandler -> DB : upsert into product_references\n(product_id, product_no, name, unit_name)

== 寫入側（倉庫名稱同步 —— Organization 目前完全沒有 Kafka，這段是「昂貴」的新增）==

box "Organization" #Pink
    participant "CreateWarehouseCommandHandler" as WarehouseHandler
    participant "新增：IIntegrationEventWriter" as OrgWriter
    participant "新增：OutboxProcessor" as OrgOutbox
end box

queue "Kafka\n新 topic：organization.warehouses.events" as WarehouseTopic

box "Inventory" #LightYellow
    participant "IntegrationEventConsumer" as Consumer2
    participant "WarehouseReferenceUpdated\nIntegrationEventHandler" as WarehouseRefHandler
end box

database "inventory_db\n（新表：warehouse_references）" as DB2

WarehouseHandler -> WarehouseHandler : Warehouse.Create(...)
note right of WarehouseHandler
  Organization 現在是 3-layer，沒有 Application
  層的 domain event / outbox 機制。要走這條路，
  得先把 Ordering/Inventory 那套 outbox pattern
  整套搬進來 —— 這不是加一個 event，是幫
  Organization 補一塊原本刻意不要的基礎設施。
end note
WarehouseHandler -> OrgWriter : WriteAsync(WarehouseCreatedIntegrationEvent\n(WarehouseId, Name))
OrgWriter -> DB : insert into outbox_messages（新表）
OrgOutbox -> WarehouseTopic : produce（新的背景輪詢服務）
WarehouseTopic -> Consumer2 : consumer.Consume()
Consumer2 -> WarehouseRefHandler : HandleAsync(notification, ct)
WarehouseRefHandler -> DB2 : upsert into warehouse_references\n(warehouse_id, name)

== 讀取側（ListStocks / ListWarehouseStocks —— 完全不呼叫其他服務）==

actor "總管理者 / 倉庫管理者 / 一般員工" as Caller

box "Inventory" #LightYellow
    participant "ListStocksEndpoint" as Endpoint
    participant "IStockReader" as Reader
end box

database "inventory_db" as DB3

Caller -> Endpoint : GET /api/v1/stocks?warehouseId=&productId=&page=&size=
Endpoint -> Reader : ListAsync(warehouseId, productId, page, size, ct)
Reader -> DB3 : select s.*, p.product_no, p.name as product_name, p.unit_name,\n       w.name as warehouse_name\nfrom stocks s\njoin product_references p on p.product_id = s.product_id\njoin warehouse_references w on w.warehouse_id = s.warehouse_id\nwhere (@ProductNo is null or p.product_no ilike @ProductNo)\n  and (@ProductName is null or p.name ilike @ProductName)\n...
DB3 --> Reader : rows（已經含名稱，文字篩選也一起做到）
Reader --> Caller : 200 OK

note over Reader, DB3
  這就是選這個方案的主要好處：查詢完全在
  Inventory 自己的 DB 裡完成，沒有任何跨服務
  的同步呼叫，也不會因為 Ordering/Organization
  掛掉而查不到庫存清單。代價是多兩張要維護
  一致性的快取表，而且 Product/Warehouse 如果
  之後支援「更新名稱」，還要再多發一個
  ProductUpdated/WarehouseUpdated 事件，
  現在的 CreateProduct/CreateWarehouse
  都還沒有對應的 Update 流程可以掛。
end note

@enduml
